 "title": "Grain Storage - Ottawa Cooperative Association",
 "text": "Grain Storage - Ottawa Cooperative Association\nSkip to main content\nWe use cookies to improve site performance and your experience. View our privacy policy for more information OK\n-->\nGrain Portal\nBushel App\nEmployment\nCustomer Login\nGo to home page\nHome\nToggle Dropdown\n-->\nDepartments -->\nDepartments\nAgronomy\nGrain\nFuel\nFeed\nFinancing\nTruterra\nTire Shop\nToggle Dropdown\n-->\nAbout -->\nAbout\nAbout Ottawa Coop\nBoard Members\nLiterature\nLocations\nContact\nToggle Dropdown\n-->\nCustomer Support -->\nCustomer Support\nForms\nContact\nLiterature\nCustomer Login (opens in new tab)\nGrain Portal (opens in new tab)\nOnline Store Go to Online Store in new window\n-->\nOnline Store Go to Online Store in new window\nGrain Storage\nGrain storage facilities are crucial for preserving harvested crops, preventing spoilage, and ensuring food security. Proper ventilation and temperature control are essential to maintain the quality of stored grains and mitigate the risk of pests and mold growth.\nGrain storage is available in the following locations:\nBurlingame\nBurlingame South\nBurlington\nEdgerton\nLeLoup\nMelvern\nMidland\nNorth Lawrence\nOttawa\nOverbrook\nPauline\nScranton\nSouth Lawrence\nSpring Hill\nWaverly\nGo to home page\nHours\nMonday-Friday 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nSaturday & Sunday: Closed\nHarvesting & planting season hours will be posted\nContact Us\n302 N. Main Street\nP.O. Box 680\nOttawa, KS 66067\nPhone: 888.242.5170\nFax: 785.242.5057\nEmail: ottawacoop@ottawacoop.com\nOnline Store Go to Online Store in new window\nonline store Go to Online Store in new window\n-->\nEmployee Login\nEmployment\nSitemap\nAccessibility\nContact\n©2024-2026 Ottawa Cooperative Association\nPowered By Merlin® Created by JNT Company, LLC",
